DevTeamStudios STR Model License
Version 0.1 — DRAFT, pending legal review
Applies to: All trained model weights, checkpoints, and derived artifacts
under ai/models/ (the "STR Models"), including but not limited to STR-3.5 Pro
and future STR-family releases.

> ⚠️ This is a first draft written to match the constraints DTS specified
> during project planning. It has NOT been reviewed by a lawyer and should
> not be treated as final or legally binding until it has been. Model
> licensing has real commercial and liability implications — get this
> reviewed before any STR model is actually released under it.

---

1. Scope

This license governs use of the STR Models — the trained weights and
checkpoints themselves — and is separate from the license covering the
Mikio AI application and platform code (see the root LICENSE file, MIT).
Using Mikio AI's application code does not grant any rights to the STR
Models beyond what's stated here, and vice versa.

2. Grant of Use

Subject to the restrictions in Section 3, DevTeamStudios grants a
non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the STR Models
for:

  (a) Personal, educational, and research use; and
  (b) Commercial use, subject to the limitations DTS may specify at the
      time of release (see Section 3(a)). DTS's intent is to expand
      commercial use over time as the STR Model family matures — current
      limitations are not necessarily permanent.

3. Restrictions

  (a) Commercial Use — Limited. Commercial use of the STR Models may be
      restricted, metered, or require a separate commercial agreement with
      DTS, as specified for each STR Model release. Where a release does
      not specify commercial terms, contact DTS before commercial
      deployment.

  (b) No Redistribution. You may not redistribute, re-host, mirror, or
      otherwise make the STR Models (or the weights/checkpoints
      themselves) available to third parties, whether unmodified or
      modified, except with DTS's prior written consent. This restriction
      applies regardless of whether redistribution is free or paid.

  (c) No Modification Without Confirmation. You may not modify, fine-tune,
      merge, quantize, distill, or otherwise create a derivative of the
      STR Models' weights without first requesting and receiving explicit
      confirmation from DTS. Using the STR Models as-is for inference is
      not "modification" under this section; altering the weights
      themselves is.

  (d) No Misrepresentation. You may not represent a modified or derived
      version of an STR Model as an official DTS or Mikio AI release.

4. Attribution

Any permitted use of an STR Model must retain a clear statement identifying
it as a DevTeamStudios STR Model, including which version (e.g.
"STR-3.5 Pro").

5. No Warranty

THE STR MODELS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS
OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NONINFRINGEMENT. DEVTEAMSTUDIOS DOES
NOT WARRANT THAT THE STR MODELS' OUTPUTS WILL BE ACCURATE, RELIABLE, OR FIT
FOR ANY PARTICULAR PURPOSE.

6. Limitation of Liability

TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, DEVTEAMSTUDIOS SHALL NOT BE LIABLE
FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES
ARISING FROM USE OF THE STR MODELS, INCLUDING DAMAGES ARISING FROM MODEL
OUTPUTS.

7. Termination

This license terminates automatically if you breach Section 3. Upon
termination, you must cease use of the STR Models and delete any copies of
their weights in your possession, except as required for legal compliance.

8. Relationship to Upstream Foundation Model

STR Models are derived from an upstream foundation model (currently
DeepSeek) via continued pretraining, instruction tuning, and preference
optimization. This license governs DTS's rights in the STR Models as
DTS's own work product; it does not modify or supersede the license terms
of the underlying upstream foundation model. Where upstream terms impose
additional obligations, both this license and the upstream terms apply.

9. Changes to This License

DTS may update this license for future STR Model releases. The license
version in effect for a given released model is the version distributed
alongside that model's release artifacts.

